{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">由張智霖、吳卓羲、高海寧、張曦雯、姜大衞、陳瀅、江美儀、陳煒和蔣祖曼等超強陣容主演的重頭劇《璀璨之城》，將於下周一（12日）隆重首播！劇集未出街已經話題十足，最大焦點絕對是兩大男神張智霖（Chilam）與吳卓羲繼《衝上雲霄II》後，相隔13年迎來「世紀合體」，這次難得的交鋒絕對令人引頸以待。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.40.23.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CaaL0jZtCu1791257398.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.40.23.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">向來有「凍齡男神」之稱的 Chilam，今次不但依然保持一貫的屈機靚仔樣，更迎來演藝生涯大突破。他激罕挑戰「奸中之奸」的反派角色，飾演的「官孝賢」城府極深、玩弄權力且做事毫無底線。早前 Chilam 接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問時，亦直認角色極度邪惡，更預告劇情尺度超乎想像：「我覺得好少喺TVB嘅劇集見到咁嘅劇情，我拍嘅時候都話『可以咁樣㗎？』，真係好期待個製成品係點樣！」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.33.14.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QLjEXRqnQw1791257399.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.33.14.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.35.30.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vSWoObCEP21791257396.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.35.30.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有別於過往深入民心的「衝動派」形象，吳卓羲今次大變身，飾演冷靜熟男「官孝君」。這個角色游走於正邪之間，做事睿智穩重，保證為觀眾帶來極大的新鮮感。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">卓羲受訪時坦言，今次最好玩的正是與 Chilam 交手飆戲：「大家都有唔同諗法，再同監製編劇傾，出嚟有新嘅感覺衝擊。」劇中這對兄弟表面上公平競爭，暗地裡卻各懷鬼胎、互相角力。光暗交錯的豪門博弈一觸即發，兩大男神瘋狂飆戲，必定火花四濺。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.34.55.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kg4qWFzjxR1791257399.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.34.55.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.34.12.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dQZUNX8dif1791257398.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.34.12.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T04:39:08.493150+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":524,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}